Third-party data, models and software
=====================================

This analysis used public resources and tools that keep their own licences.
Verified 24 October 2026 from the upstream files or pages named below. Where
a current licence file could not be retrieved, the entry says so and the
upstream terms apply.

Data and models

- GRCh38 no-alt analysis set (NCBI / Genome Reference Consortium). United
  States government work; publicly redistributable. See NCBI genome data
  terms.
- gnomAD allele frequencies (Broad Institute). Use is subject to the gnomAD
  terms of use (https://gnomad.broadinstitute.org/terms). Redistribution of
  the full dataset is not part of this repository.
- ClinVar (NCBI). Public database; see NCBI ClinVar terms.
- MANE Select transcripts (NCBI and EMBL-EBI). See Morales et al. 2022 and
  the MANE project terms.
- Human Phenotype Ontology. See the current HPO licence at
  https://hpo.jax.org/ (upstream terms apply).
- AlphaMissense code (Google DeepMind): Apache License 2.0
  (https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphamissense/blob/main/LICENSE).
  Variant-score tables used here remain under DeepMind's published data
  terms; see upstream.
- REVEL. See the authors' distribution terms (Ioannidis et al. 2016);
  upstream terms apply.
- AlphaGenome. Google DeepMind published terms; see upstream.
- SpliceAI models: CC BY-NC 4.0 for academic and non-commercial use; source
  code PolyForm Strict License 1.0.0
  (https://github.com/Illumina/SpliceAI/blob/master/LICENSE).
- PrimeKG repository: MIT License
  (https://github.com/mims-harvard/PrimeKG/blob/main/LICENSE).
- Genome in a Bottle (NIST). United States government work; publicly
  redistributable. See NIST GIAB terms.

Software

- bwa-mem2: MIT License (https://github.com/bwa-mem2/bwa-mem2/blob/master/LICENSE).
- samtools and bcftools: MIT/Expat License
  (https://github.com/samtools/samtools/blob/develop/LICENSE).
- GATK: Apache License 2.0
  (https://github.com/broadinstitute/gatk/blob/master/LICENSE.TXT).
- DeepVariant: BSD 3-Clause License
  (https://github.com/google/deepvariant/blob/r1.6.1/LICENSE).
- Strelka2 (Illumina). Licence file was not retrieved from the tagged
  upstream tree on 24 October 2026; see upstream terms.
- Manta: PolyForm Strict License 1.0.0
  (https://github.com/Illumina/manta/blob/master/LICENSE.txt).
- Delly: BSD 3-Clause License
  (https://github.com/dellytools/delly/blob/main/LICENSE).
- WhatsHap: MIT License (https://github.com/whatshap/whatshap/blob/main/LICENSE).
- mosdepth: MIT License (https://github.com/brentp/mosdepth/blob/master/LICENSE).
- somalier: MIT License (https://github.com/brentp/somalier/blob/master/LICENSE).
- VerifyBamID2. Licence file was not retrieved from the upstream tree on
  24 October 2026; see upstream terms.
- snpEff: MIT License (https://github.com/pcingola/SnpEff/blob/master/LICENSE.md).
- scripts/figstyle.py: adapted from alphaXiv OpenResearch (orx_figstyle.py),
  MIT License.

Use of these resources in this hackathon analysis does not change their
licences and does not grant any extra rights in the restricted patient data.
